  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify M7-W01-C01-T1 as a bounded research Q/O/D: compare exact BigInteger cancellation against binary64, prove one rational 1/10 enclosure from adjacent IEEE 754 doubles, and screen provider strategies. Keep M7/W01/C01 active and T2 planned. No new precision/interval API, provider, package, public release or sibling integration.",
    "value": "Supply two independently hand-checkable BCL numeric reference cases, Q/O/D admission notes and an explicit managed/native provider cost and qualification matrix. Distinguish calculation precision, arithmetic enclosure and physical measurement uncertainty. Record the oracle execution only after DWF runs, leaving provider adoption/deferral for T2.",
    "nextAction": "On durable RS106 success, prepare T2 to admit a bounded provider contract only with independent source/version/license/RID/rounding and consumer qualification, or explicitly defer with trigger. Preserve the existing Math exact contracts and unapproved external/public boundaries.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Arbitrary real precision and certified interval evaluation remain unadmitted; do not imply they exist from exact BigInteger witnesses.",
      "One adjacent-double enclosure of 1/10 is not a general outward-rounding guarantee or a statistical/physical uncertainty bound.",
      "Candidate managed and native providers require exact source/version, license/notices, TFM/RID and offline runtime inspection.",
      "Before any public precision API: bound memory/time/operation domains, cancellation, overflow and independent consumer oracles.",
      "M7-W01-C01-T2, C01, W01 and M7 remain unfinished; completed spike research is not delivered product functionality."
    ],
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C01-T1-A",
        "achievement": "Fix the accepted precision research question, existing exact-rational baseline and two independently falsifiable finite numerical oracles."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C01-T1-B",
        "achievement": "Execute BCL-only exact cancellation and adjacent-double 1/10 enclosure checks; record a bounded candidate-provider cost and evidence screen."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C01-T1-C",
        "achievement": "Defer unqualified high-precision/interval providers while admitting only exact research fixtures, owner gates and T2 decision criteria."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C01-T1",
        "achievement": "Complete the research Q/O/D with exact oracle evidence and a provider matrix, without claiming any new scientific runtime capability."
      }
    ]
  },
